  "description": "AHEPOU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C52 H62 Dy6 N16 O34,2(C1 H4 O1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.041-4.177 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.51-117.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(EDDC)2(OAc)14(H2O)2]·MeOH·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 14 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
